  fhir:DomainResource.text [
     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "generated" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet VS-CoreUploadSet</b></p><a name=\"VS-CoreUploadSet\"> </a><a name=\"hcVS-CoreUploadSet\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Import all the codes that are contained in the intersection of <a href=\"ValueSet-VS-CoreDataset.html\">健康檢查核心檢驗項目值集（主管機關最小上傳集之檢驗子集）</a></li><li>Import all the codes that are contained in the intersection of <a href=\"ValueSet-VS-TWHAVitalSigns.html\">職業健檢生命徵象項目值集</a></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://loinc.org\"><code>http://loinc.org</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/72166-2/\">72166-2</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Tobacco smoking status</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/64218-1/\">64218-1</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">How many cigarettes do you smoke per day now [PhenX]</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/63632-4/\">63632-4</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">About how long has it been since you completely quit smoking cigarettes [TUS-CPS]</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\"><code>http://snomed.info/sct</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/698188003\">698188003</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Chews betel quid</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
  ] ;
